# Local provider/module cache
.terraform/

# Any state that ends up on disk (e.g. a stray `terraform apply` before init,
# or `terraform state pull`). Remote state is authoritative; local copies are
# credential-adjacent and must never be committed.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info

# Variable files may carry secrets
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
